Fixed. In advanceTurn (src/sim.ts:43) the growth check was `foodSurplus >= 0`, so a settlement whose food production exactly equals consumption (surplus = 0) still gained a population each turn — which compounded into endless growth. Changed it to `foodSurplus > 0`, so population only grows on a true surplus.

Verified: `npm run test` (4/4 passed) and `npm run typecheck` both clean.


